/E (A web-based system for automated aviation forecast verification was developed to streamline the verification of aviation weather forecasts using METAR and upper-air observations. The system improves the speed and accuracy of forecast evaluation, generates comprehensive reports and graphical analyses, reduces manual effort, and ensures consistent verification. This solution can assist the Indian Meteorological Department \(IMD\) in enhancing forecast quality, reliability, and overall operational efficiency.)
